task_outcome OUT_T_OBSERVATION_PROTOCOL:
  model 1
  task T_OBSERVATION_PROTOCOL
  against_basis sha256:996c695d42c8c0529df3e64777fe7967dd892266a0b20b2dea0610ebb9e18641
  status conformant
  reason "The protocol records persisted-turn insufficiency, rejects prose-based inference, fixes a server-only privacy-safe envelope, local-file-only adapter boundary, sample and effectiveness gates, descriptive-only claims, and a separate capture-authority decision before runtime or data access."

task_outcome OUT_T_OFFLINE_OBSERVER:
  model 1
  task T_OFFLINE_OBSERVER
  against_basis sha256:015ab0efc9eaa791f1417519472a977ce9e021196c81a87089d7671b2a441227
  status conformant
  reason "A strict versioned privacy-safe envelope and explicit local-file-only observer were implemented. Seven targeted tests verify opaque refs, identical source digests, no private output, persisted-record insufficient_source without inference, dangling-ref reporting, mutation fail-closed behavior, and no DB network provider LLM XAI or runtime-service dependency. All 380 repository tests, typecheck, and build pass; actual capture remains untested and unauthorized."
